# US English's main volume. A word here is matched as the whole token it is
# written as, capitals and all, so Qt here is not qt and MATE is not mate;
# what is said in its place can be several words. One a line, the word, a
# tab, and what is said; a line starting # is a remark.
#
# The entries straight after this are the body, kept sorted by the tools
# that write it: tools/measure/dictgate.py, which takes in the community's
# later changes, and tools/measure/published.py. Blocks decided by hand come
# after it, each under a remark saying why, and the tools leave their words
# alone. An entry taken out is in removed, and docs/language.md says how to
# add one.

